{"displayStem":"동일한 다섯 감쇠값으로 만든 CT 팬텀을 가와 나의 창 설정으로 표시했다. 밝기 변환은 LINEAR_EXACT 선형 함수이며 범위 밖 값은 검정 또는 흰색으로 포화된다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 독립 작성 모의자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 팬텀 · 실제 CT 영상 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C10 c10-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"c10-visual\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 균질 팬텀의 CT 창 설정별 표시\"><text x=\"270\" y=\"25\" text-anchor=\"middle\">가: 중심 40 HU / 너비 400 HU</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(77,77,77)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"70\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-40 HU</text><rect x=\"125\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(102,102,102)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"170\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0 HU</text><rect x=\"225\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(128,128,128)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"270\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40 HU</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(153,153,153)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"370\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">80 HU</text><rect x=\"425\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(179,179,179)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"470\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">120 HU</text></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 균질 팬텀의 CT 창 설정별 표시\"><text x=\"270\" y=\"25\" text-anchor=\"middle\">나: 중심 40 HU / 너비 80 HU</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(0,0,0)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"70\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-40 HU</text><rect x=\"125\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(0,0,0)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"170\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0 HU</text><rect x=\"225\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(128,128,128)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"270\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40 HU</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(255,255,255)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"370\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">80 HU</text><rect x=\"425\" y=\"48\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" fill=\"rgb(255,255,255)\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"470\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">120 HU</text></svg></div></div></div>"]}